Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.50,-1:59:59.60,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,465)}H007  
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.50,-1:59:59.60,TitleJa,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,575)}日々のリズム
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:01:27.96,Header,,0,0,0,,H007  •  現在形（不変の真理・ことわざ・習慣・時刻表）
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.37,English,,0,0,0,,On Monday morning, I get up at half past six.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:04.37,0:00:06.12,English,,0,0,0,,This is my habit.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:06.12,0:00:10.50,English,,0,0,0,,In the kitchen I make coffee and open the newspaper.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:10.50,0:00:12.68,English,,0,0,0,,That is my daily rhythm.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:12.68,0:00:17.93,English,,0,0,0,,At the station I take the train and commute to my office.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:17.93,0:00:19.68,English,,0,0,0,,The journey is ordinary.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:19.68,0:00:25.54,English,,0,0,0,,In a crowded car, many passengers stand silently.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:25.54,0:00:30.24,English,,0,0,0,,I work for a small local company.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:30.24,0:00:35.46,English,,0,0,0,,My coworkers are kind, and a colleague often laughs loudly.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:35.46,0:00:39.52,English,,0,0,0,,Each person carries out their duties.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:39.52,0:00:44.10,English,,0,0,0,,At noon we gather for lunch together.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:44.10,0:00:50.12,English,,0,0,0,,In the afternoon, I finish one task after another.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:50.12,0:00:53.78,English,,0,0,0,,The phone rings, and a new request appears.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:55.12,0:00:59.04,English,,0,0,0,,Work proceeds in a steady way.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:59.04,0:01:07.99,English,,0,0,0,,In the evening the same common faces return to the station, and people rush home.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:07.99,0:01:17.52,English,,0,0,0,,Through the train window I look beyond the tall buildings at the fading sky.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:19.14,0:01:27.76,English,,0,0,0,,Within these quiet days, a small sense of purpose lives, and I believe in it.
